arguments.new_string:
## How we prioritise

Roughly in this order, although real life is messier than any list:

1) security and data-loss issues, always and immediately;
2) things that block people from running Marmot in production (see the
   [`production-blocker`](https://github.com/marmot-flags/marmot/labels/production-blocker) label);
3) work that reduces the maintenance burden &mdash; we are a small team;
4) new features, weighted by 👍 reactions *and* by how well they fit the project.

Sponsored work is welcome but goes through the same process; paying for a feature buys
priority, not a different definition of "done".

## Legend

